{"title":"LaTeX:Diagrams","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"border:1px solid black; background:#CEE0F2;text-align:center;\" align=\"center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#B0C4DE;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX\" title=\"LaTeX\">LaTeX</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX:About\" title=\"LaTeX:About\">About</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX:LaTeX_on_AoPS\" title=\"LaTeX:LaTeX on AoPS\">Getting Started</a> - <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Diagrams</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX:Symbols\" title=\"LaTeX:Symbols\">Symbols</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX:Downloads\" title=\"LaTeX:Downloads\">Downloads</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX:Basics\" title=\"LaTeX:Basics\">Basics</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX:Math\" title=\"LaTeX:Math\">Math</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX:Examples\" title=\"LaTeX:Examples\">Examples</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX:Pictures\" title=\"LaTeX:Pictures\">Pictures</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX:Layout\" title=\"LaTeX:Layout\">Layout</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX:Commands\" title=\"LaTeX:Commands\">Commands</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX:Packages\" title=\"LaTeX:Packages\">Packages</a> - <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX:Help\" title=\"LaTeX:Help\">Help</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Diagrams_and_Figures\">Diagrams and Figures</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=LaTeX:Diagrams&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Diagrams and Figures\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Usually <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/Asymptote_(Vector_Graphics_Language)\">Asymptote</a> is used for drawing diagrams and figures because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/b/27bb8d5acf15ea850c966cc6b82b448f35681a19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{\\LaTeX}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> does not have the ability to output good diagrams for geometry and other subjects. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/b/27bb8d5acf15ea850c966cc6b82b448f35681a19.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{\\LaTeX}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" /> works very well with Asymptote.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017214003\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.021 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 12/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 550/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 366/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.815      1 Template:Latex\n100.00%    7.815      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:14363:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017214003 and revision id 279431. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}